{
  "title": "Jazzy Crispy Tunisian Tofu Dumplings",
  "description": "Briny, crunchy brunch‑mood dumplings infused with Tunisian flavor, made with silken tofu and gluten‑free ingredients for a light yet satisfying bite.",
