  "instructions": [
    "Combine silken tofu, lemon juice, salt, pepper, and harissa paste in a bowl until smooth.",
    "Fold in gluten‑free flour, tapioca flour, and panko breadcrumbs until mixture holds together.",
    "Shape mixture into 1‑inch balls and set aside on parchment paper.",
    "Heat olive oil in a non‑stick skillet over medium‑high heat.",
    "Cook dumplings for 3 minutes on each side until golden brown and crispy.",
    "Remove from skillet and place on paper towels to drain excess oil.",
    "Sprinkle chopped cilantro over hot dumplings just before serving.",
    "Serve with a side of tangy hummus or tzatziki for dipping."
